bsnes-jg-wasm — a WebAssembly build of bsnes-jg + a loader page.

This project builds and redistributes the following under the GNU GPL v3:

  bsnes-jg
    A cycle-accurate Super Famicom / SNES emulator; fork of bsnes v115.
    Upstream:        https://gitlab.com/jgemu/bsnes   (the "Jolly Good" fork)
    libretro core:   https://github.com/libretro/bsnes-jg
    bsnes original:  Near (byuu) et al.
    License:         GNU General Public License, version 3 (see LICENSE)

The loader page uses EmulatorJS (https://emulatorjs.org), GPLv3, loaded from its
CDN in "showcase" mode.

Bundled ROMs (web/roms/*.sfc) are homebrew demos compiled by the llvm-mos-65816
toolchain (https://github.com/wbniv/llvm-mos-65816) from that project's own
example sources — included here so the page runs out of the box.

The build scripts, loader page, and documentation original to this repository are
licensed GPLv3 to match the core they ship.
